---
import ApertureIcon from './ApertureIcon.astro';
---
<section class="sec-block" id="nilai">
	<div class="kicker sec-anim">
		<ApertureIcon />
		<span>Termasuk Otomatis</span>
	</div>
	
	<div class="mb-[36px] sec-anim">
		<h2 class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold tracking-tight mb-[8px]">Yang sudah termasuk di setiap sewa</h2>
		<p class="text-text-muted text-[15px] max-w-[560px] font-body">
			Tidak ada biaya tambahan mendadak untuk hal-hal ini — semuanya sudah dihitung dalam tarif per jam.
		</p>
	</div>
	
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-[20px] sec-anim">
		<div class="value-card group bg-card backdrop-blur-[14px] border border-border rounded-[8px] p-[24px] shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] card-hover">
			<div class="w-[36px] h-[36px] rounded-[8px] bg-accent-soft text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-[14px] transition-colors duration-350 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[#fff8ee]">
				<i class="ph ph-lightning text-[18px] transition-transform duration-400 group-hover:rotate-[28deg] cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)"></i>
			</div>
			<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[16px] mb-[7px]">Lighting siap pakai</h3>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">
				Strobe 600W, trigger nirkabel, C-stand, dan pilihan modifier tersedia di ruangan.
			</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="value-card group bg-card backdrop-blur-[14px] border border-border rounded-[8px] p-[24px] shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] card-hover">
			<div class="w-[36px] h-[36px] rounded-[8px] bg-accent-soft text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-[14px] transition-colors duration-350 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[#fff8ee]">
				<i class="ph ph-headset text-[18px] transition-transform duration-400 group-hover:rotate-[28deg] cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)"></i>
			</div>
			<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[16px] mb-[7px]">Asisten on-set</h3>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">
				Membantu atur posisi lampu, ganti modifier, dan pasang background selama sesi.
			</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="value-card group bg-card backdrop-blur-[14px] border border-border rounded-[8px] p-[24px] shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] card-hover">
			<div class="w-[36px] h-[36px] rounded-[8px] bg-accent-soft text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-[14px] transition-colors duration-350 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[#fff8ee]">
				<i class="ph ph-sparkle text-[18px] transition-transform duration-400 group-hover:rotate-[28deg] cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)"></i>
			</div>
			<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[16px] mb-[7px]">Ruang rias privat</h3>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">
				Meja rias dan cermin dengan pencahayaan high-CRI, terpisah dari area shoot.
			</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="value-card group bg-card backdrop-blur-[14px] border border-border rounded-[8px] p-[24px] shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] card-hover">
			<div class="w-[36px] h-[36px] rounded-[8px] bg-accent-soft text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-[14px] transition-colors duration-350 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[#fff8ee]">
				<i class="ph ph-shield-check text-[18px] transition-transform duration-400 group-hover:rotate-[28deg] cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)"></i>
			</div>
			<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[16px] mb-[7px]">Tarif tanpa jebakan</h3>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">
				Tidak ada biaya kebersihan atau administrasi tambahan di luar yang tertera.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>